{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a peak into the world of Nekogumi, this demo allows players to experience the world of Nekogumi through Bruce's eyes. The demo includes day 0-5 and includes an array of cosmetics and furnishing items that are curated for the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of Bruce, the tuxedo cat with a passion for cosplay and a knack for leadership in Nekogumi! This single-player, third-person cafe-adventure game is a cozy haven where you\u2019ll transform a humble cat caf\u00e9 into the heart of the neighbourhood. <strong>Earn coins, upgrade furniture, and expand your wardrobe</strong> as Bruce dons quirky costumes in his quest to protect the hood. Complete quests, <strong>recruit charmingly odd companions</strong>, and battle pesky rats\u2014all while bouncing through a world filled with cute and vibrant adventures. Ready to be the feline superhero your neighbourhood didn\u2019t know it needed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nekogumi is a single player, third person cafe-adventure game. It is a <strong>cozy game</strong> where you\u2019d find companions among silly and funny animals and work together to protect and bring prosper to the neighbourhood.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Run the hood and your caf\u00e9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Earn coins to buy new furniture for the caf\u00e9, or spend it all on your wardrobe, it's your choice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994070/extras/2b6537eac0c3f3abbe4f09d9cfffb99f.poster.avif?t=1757076505\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994070/extras/2b6537eac0c3f3abbe4f09d9cfffb99f.webm?t=1757076505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Play dressup with Bruce, when will you ever get a cat to cooperate with weird costumes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994070/extras/fc51abe21f28ac1896dac7b131d50eba.poster.avif?t=1757076505\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994070/extras/fc51abe21f28ac1896dac7b131d50eba.webm?t=1757076505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994070/extras/fc51abe21f28ac1896dac7b131d50eba.mp4?t=1757076505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\u2022 Live out the imaginary fantasy of being the hood boss or a feline superhero. This cat loooooves to cosplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994070/extras/b6ea020c0f5a8b60454ab8a19b309684.poster.avif?t=1757076505\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994070/extras/b6ea020c0f5a8b60454ab8a19b309684.webm?t=1757076505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994070/extras/b6ea020c0f5a8b60454ab8a19b309684.mp4?t=1757076505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Complete quests, fight some rats and clean up the neighbourhoo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994070/extras/c399881